Chapter: TcoGuardProbe

 A self-recursive function takes the plug's tail-call path, which is a
 different emitter from the ordinary match. The guarded arm here would fire
 on every call if its guard were dropped, so a dropped guard answers 999
 where the truth is 10.

Section: Subjects

  walk : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  walk (n) (acc) =
   when n
    is 0 -> acc
    is x when x > 100 -> 999
    is otherwise -> walk (n - 1) (acc + n)

  sink : Integer -> Integer
  sink (n) =
   when n
    is 0 -> 7
    is otherwise -> sink (n - 1)

Section: Report

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni (show (walk 4 0))
   print-line-uni (show (walk 200 0))
   print-line-uni (show (sink 3))
